            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 45,
              "start": 45
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioner argues that the \u201cne exeat\u201d provision does not create an affirmative right for the father to determine the child\u2019s residence."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. ANDERS",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e4252ced49a05b56390cc2b42a2bb33e56610eb9dd24a84438800219a8c87a17",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-e4252ced49a0-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 29,
              "start": 29
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. ANDERS, the Court must decide whether a joint\u2011right to determine residence under a divorce decree qualifies as \u201ccustody\u201d for purposes of the Convention."
      }
    ],
