            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The case concerns how the Hague Convention addresses custody and whether a \u201cne exeat\u201d provision gives a parent an affirmative right to prevent a child\u2019s removal."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e4252ced49a05b56390cc2b42a2bb33e56610eb9dd24a84438800219a8c87a17",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-e4252ced49a0-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Convention\u2019s purpose is to protect the parent who has the primary relationship with the child from having that relationship severed by removal of the child."
      }
    ],
